# The scenes of the characterisation-tests deck, in order. Each "## Scene N: title" is one slide, spoken with item N of
# characterisation-tests.narration.md. Each line under a heading puts one thing on the slide:
#   note "<text>"         a line of text
#   show <file> ...       a code panel: <from> <to> or /pattern/, then a label; --mark and --zoom mark lines
#   run_live "<command>"  a live run, played from its cast in characterisation-tests.outputs/
#   callout "<text>"      a boxed sentence saying what a result means

## Scene 1: step 1, the version catalogue
note "Step 1: add ApprovalTests to the version catalogue."
show libs.versions.toml "/approvaltests/" "gradle/libs.versions.toml"

## Scene 2: step 2, the test dependency
note "Step 2: add it as a test dependency of the lesson. There is nothing to configure."
show lessons/characterisation-tests/example/build.gradle.kts "/libs.approvaltests/" "lesson build file" --zoom 9

## Scene 3: the code under test
note "The code under test: a statement printer that has run for years without tests."
show LegacyStatement 14 31 --zoom 21-22

## Scene 4: the weak test
note "A *weak* test, the kind legacy code often has: it checks only that something came back."
show StatementWeakTest 16 24 --zoom 22-23

## Scene 5: the characterisation test
note "The *characterisation* test: print a month that reaches every rule, and approve the whole statement."
show StatementCharacterisationTest 16 33 --zoom 25

## Scene 6: the tests pass, and the approved statement
note "Run the tests against the legacy printer:"
run_live "./gradlew :lessons:characterisation-tests:test"
show StatementCharacterisationTest.printsTheSameStatementAsToday.approved.txt 1 10 "the approved statement" --zoom 3-4
callout "After the rent the balance is exactly 0, and a fee is charged: a quirk, now pinned down."

## Scene 7: the refactored printer
note "A tidier rewrite of the printer, and the same test run against it:"
show RefactoredStatement 15 31 "the tidier rewrite" --zoom 22
run_live "./gradlew :lessons:characterisation-tests:test -Pcode=today"
callout "The fee at zero has gone. Fix or bug? A question for the Application Owner."
